 <h3><u>Ali ali ali ali bol</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>ALI ALI ALI ALI bol..(8)</p> 
  <p>Misam ki tarah tune..(2) gar hona hai anmol<br> ALI ALI ALI ALI bol..(4)</p> 
  <p>1. Khud bigda hua tera<br> har kaam banaegi..(2)<br> taqdeer tere piche piche chali aaegi<br> dar dar na laga fere..(2)<br> bus todke kashkol<br> ALI ALI ALI ALI bol..(4)</p> 
  <p>2. Baghdad ki galiyo me<br> ye kaisi tijaarat hai..(2)<br> Pucha jo zubaida ne kya khuld ki qeemat hai<br> Rukh sue najaf karke..(2)<br> Kehne lage bahlol<br> ALI ALI ALI ALI bol..(4)</p> 
  <p>3. Ye raaz koi samajta nai nabi ke siwa<br> Mujhe kisise mohabbat nai ali ke siwa<br> Fishare qabr se dozakh se aur mushkil se<br> Koi bacha nai sakta ali ali ke siwa<br> ALI ALI ALI ALI bol..(4)</p> 
  <p>4. Milne ke liye tujhse aaye hai tere maula<br> Tu ashiq e haider hai kya khauf hai turbat ka<br> Bole ye malak mujhse..(2)<br> Ankhe toh zara khol<br> ALI ALI ALI ALI bol..(4)</p> 
  <p>5. Maula ki mavaddat se<br> maulai banata hai..(2)<br> Aulad ko har momin bachpan se sikhata hai<br> Jab rab ne zabaa di hai..(2)<br> ab aur na kuch bol<br> ALI ALI ALI ALI bol..(4)</p> 
  <p>6. Yahi wazifa hai mera yahi taraana hai<br> Ali wali se ta'aluk bada purana hai<br> Zamaane maanle ye mashwara takallum ka<br> Munafiqo se aqeeda agar chupana hai<br> ALI ALI ALI ALI bol..(4)</p> 
